Hello,

I'm trying to run a dependent SCR-RSF model, because some of the collared animals were captured in my scat samples. However, there are a few individuals that were captured more than once. The cap.tel <http://cap.tel> code in the vignette only allows for 1 capture for each collared animal. Do I combine individual-specific lists of the row numbers into one final list (cap.tel <http://cap.tel>)?

Thank you!

